 outlook:{name:'Outlook',category:'Communication',description:'Keep grant mail and important dates close together.',workflow:'Grant correspondence and deadlines',detail:'Plan a view of grant-related correspondence and calendar dates from your Outlook account. Choose a folder to start with.',field:'Preferred mail folder',placeholder:'Grant correspondence',preview:'A clearer week ahead',message:'Review funder messages beside the application timeline. Confirm any proposed calendar dates before adding them.'},
